    "content": "Goal section\n* [[L]] and [[R]]: Please clarify in the statement.:\n   • What do you mean by \"numbers\"? Do they refer to position indexes or uncomfortable indexes or anything else?\n   • What if a student is at either end of the line? Is [[L]] or [[R]] equal to 0 in that case?\n   • What if a student is not standing next to a student of the other class? Is [[L]] or [[R]] equal to 0 in that case?\n\n* Please fix the typo: \" all student's \" => \" all students' \".\n\nInput section\n* For ALL lines, please include:\n   • variable type,\n   • brief description, and\n   • a mention of \"space-separated\".\n\nOutput section\n* Please write a brief description instead of the generic word \"answer\".\n\nConstraints section\n* Does \"Sum of Ai, Bi\" mean \"Sum of all Ai + Sum of all Bi\" or \"Sum of all Ai, Sum of all Bi\" or \"sum of any pair of Ai and Bi\"? Please clarify. Also, under some of the above-mentioned definitions, some cases have violated that constraint. If so, please fix the constraint and/or the cases.\n\nStub generator\n* Please add a write statement (e.g. \"write answer\").\n\nThanks.",
